{"id":"a8920a3443f47ce4","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget.md","title":"集合覆盖的互补集合器件","display":"df-set-cover-partition-gadget — 集合覆盖的互补集合器件","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget","aliases":["28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget"],"display":"df-set-cover-partition-gadget — 集合覆盖的互补集合器件","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Definition 22.32","source_printed_pages":"486","source_pdf_pages":"512","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-set-cover-partition-gadget — 集合覆盖的互补集合器件"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 22.32"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"486"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"512"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为有限非空集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(k,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}\">\\([j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell\\subseteq B\">\\(C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell\\subseteq B\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}\">\\(J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 是带标号的集合选择；互补是在 B 内取补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{i,0}\\coloneqq C_i,\\qquad C_{i,1}\\coloneqq B\\setminus C_i.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{i,0}\\coloneqq C_i,\\qquad C_{i,1}\\coloneqq B\\setminus C_i.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SetGadget}(B,(C_i)_{i=1}^\\ell;k)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\left[|J|\\le k\\land\\bigcup_{(i,b)\\in J}C_{i,b}=B\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in[\\ell]\\;\\{(i,0),(i,1)\\}\\subseteq J\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SetGadget}(B,(C_i)_{i=1}^\\ell;k)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\left[|J|\\le k\\land\\bigcup_{(i,b)\\in J}C_{i,b}=B\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in[\\ell]\\;\\{(i,0),(i,1)\\}\\subseteq J\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>器件要求任意不超过 k 个候选集合若覆盖 B，就必须选中某一对互补集合；不是要求任意 k 个集合都不能覆盖。保留集合标号，即使不同标号恰好对应同一子集，也能表达正确的互补对结构。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Definition 22.32；印刷页 486；PDF 页 512。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"k,\\ell\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"[j]=\\{1,\\ldots,j\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C_1,\\ldots,C_\\ell\\subseteq B","display":false},{"tex":"J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"C_{i,0}\\coloneqq C_i,\\qquad C_{i,1}\\coloneqq B\\setminus C_i.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SetGadget}(B,(C_i)_{i=1}^\\ell;k)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall J\\subseteq[\\ell]\\times\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\left[|J|\\le k\\land\\bigcup_{(i,b)\\in J}C_{i,b}=B\\Rightarrow\\exists i\\in[\\ell]\\;\\{(i,0),(i,1)\\}\\subseteq J\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1526,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-408","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-csp-instance]]、[[28-df-cl-reduction]]、[[28-df-constraint-graph]]、[[28-df-projection-game]]、[[28-df-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-thm-raz-parallel-repetition]]、[[28-df-long-code]]、[[28-df-bifolded-boolean-function]]、[[28-lem-bifolding-fourier-odd-support]]、[[28-thm-blr-fourier-linearity-test]]、[[28-df-noisy-long-code-test]]、[[28-lem-noisy-long-code-fourier-moment]]、[[28-df-set-cover-partition-gadget]]、[[28-thm-hastad-three-query-pcp]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}